Some aliases to make it easier to work with the service. Add these to your shell configuration file (e.g., .bashrc / .bashrc_aliases or .zshrc / .zshrc_aliases), most likely in your home directory.

alias rasplivelog="journalctl -u mqtt-subscribe-to-all.service -f"
alias rasplog='cat "$HOME/.local/share/mqtt-logs/mqtt-subscribe-to-all.log"'